cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ppflx-bench: benchmarks for privacy-preserving federated learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mehdi
    family-names: Valinejad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9154-9606"
  - name: "CorpiXo"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/CorpiXo/ppflx-bench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark harness for ppflx, a privacy-preserving federated learning
  library: the same federated run under twelve privacy configurations
  (homomorphic encryption, Groth16 zero-knowledge proofs of bounded model
  updates, differential-privacy noise and their combinations), compared on cost
  and model quality, with a per-round audit ledger.
